Google's internal USB-camera table omits the Lenovo E50-80 EasyCamera
(0bda:579c), so the USB HAL advertises it as external and camera apps
list no camera. Mark this exact USB ID front-facing without inventing
lens/sensor calibration. Appended at the end so it stays independent of
the MSI entry. Drop when Google's table includes this webcam.

--- a/etc/camera/internal_usb_camera_info.txtpb
+++ b/etc/camera/internal_usb_camera_info.txtpb
@@ -305,3 +305,9 @@
     }
   }
 }
+camera_modules {
+  key: "0bda:579c" # Lenovo E50-80 integrated EasyCamera
+  value {
+    facing: FACING_FRONT
+  }
+}
